TITLE  ARGUS corpus: caja (paralelo)
       .
       >>>>>>>> Source definition.
SKPAR  2              [Primary particles: 1=e-, 2=ph, 3=e+, 4=h, 5=a]
SLINES 6.617E5 0.851                    [Line energy and probability]
SLINES 3.2E4 0.07                       [Line energy and probability]
SPOSIT 0 0 -5                              [Coordinates of the source]
SCONE  0 0 8                           [Conical beam; angles in deg]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Material data and simulation parameters.
MFNAME water.mat                      [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4 1e3       [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 1e4          [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
MFNAME hueso.mat                      [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4 1e3       [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 1e4          [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Geometry and local simulation parameters.
GEOMFN caja.geo                      [Geometry file, up to 20 chars]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Emerging particles. Energy and angular distributions.
NBE    0 0 100                       [Energy window and no. of bins]
NBANGL 30 4               [No. of bins for the angles THETA and PHI]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Impact detectors (up to 5 different detectors).
IMPDET 1e3 7e5 70 0 1          [E-window, no. of bins, IPSF, IDCUT]
IDBODY 'PLAN'                                            [Active body]
IMPDET 1e3 7e5 -50 0 2         [E-window, no. of bins, IPSF, IDCUT]
IDAGEL 0 2e-9 50                       [Age interval and no. of bins]
IDBODY 'DETE'                                            [Active body]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Outer angular detectors (up to 5).
ANGDET 90 180 0 360                   [Angular window, angles in deg]
ADENER 1e3 7e5 70                     [Energy window and no. of bins]
ANGDET 0 30 0 360                     [Angular window, angles in deg]
ADENER 1e3 7e5 70                     [Energy window and no. of bins]
ADKPAR 2                                 [Type of detected particles]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Energy-deposition detectors (up to 5).
ENDETC 0 7e5 140                      [Energy window and no. of bins]
EDBODY 'DETE'                                            [Active body]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Absorbed dose distribution.
GRIDX  -5 5 5             [X coords of the box vertices, no. of bins]
GRIDY  -5 5 5             [Y coords of the box vertices, no. of bins]
GRIDZ  0 5 10             [Z coords of the box vertices, no. of bins]
       .
       >>>>>>>> Job properties.
DUMPTO dump.dmp                  [Generate this dump file, 20 chars]
DUMPP  30                                   [Dumping period, in sec]
       .
NSIMSH 6e3                     [Desired number of simulated showers]
TIME   2e9                         [Allotted simulation time, in sec]
RSEED  -1 0                       [Seeds of the random-number generator]
